  Title: Musica e strumenti
  TitleKey: 
  SubTitle: Conoscenza musicologica e storica di Claudio Monteverdi
  SubTitleKey: 
  Type: 1
  ProfilingData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1a7675bc264f2b34182debe8ee29c5ed, type: 2}
  Questions:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Per dare vita a Cenerentola, Prokof'ev impieg\xF2 un'intera orchestra
        sinfonica. Quanti musicisti la compongono?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Meno di 10 musicisti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Oltre 80 musicisti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Circa 40 musicisti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Circa 15 musicisti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "L'orchestra \xE8 divisa in famiglie di strumenti. Quali tra questi strumenti
        appartengono alla famiglia degli archi?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tromba
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Contrabbasso
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Violino
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Viola
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Timpani
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Oboe
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Nella sezione 'Strumenti da vicino' ogni strumento ha un ruolo preciso.
        Quali abbinamenti strumento-ruolo sono corretti?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: L'arpa rappresenta le sorellastre goffe e comiche
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il corno francese, audace e maestoso, annuncia l'arrivo del principe
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il violino suona il tema gentile e lirico di Cenerentola
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il flauto imita i timpani della mezzanotte
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Prima e durante la visita in VR ti viene affidata una 'missione di concentrazione'.
        In che cosa consiste?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Disegnare la pianta della sala da concerto
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Contare quante persone ci sono tra il pubblico
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Memorizzare i nomi di tutti i ballerini
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Individuare almeno 5 strumenti diversi e ascoltare come cambia la musica
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Il foglio di lavoro suggerisce di ricordare com'era la musica nella
        realt\xE0 virtuale per intuirne l'atmosfera. Quali coppie di 'indizi' sonori
        indica?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Veloce o lenta (il tempo)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Corta o lunga (la durata del biglietto)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nuova o vecchia (l'anno di composizione)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Soffice o forte (la dinamica)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Alta o bassa (l'altezza del suono)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Applicando il metodo 'scena \u2192 emozione \u2192 strumento', quali
        associazioni proposte dalla lezione sono corrette?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Cenerentola sola a casa \u2192 trionfante \u2192 trombe squillanti"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "L'arrivo della Fata Madrina \u2192 cupa e spaventosa \u2192 timpani"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Il Gran Ballo \u2192 gioiosa e grandiosa \u2192 l'intera orchestra"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Cenerentola sola a casa \u2192 triste e tenera \u2192 violino"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "La mezzanotte \u2192 calma e dolce \u2192 arpa delicata"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Il Gran Ballo \u2192 triste \u2192 un solo violoncello"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Quali di queste informazioni sull'identit\xE0 dell'opera sono corrette?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Debutt\xF2 nel 1945"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Fu composta nel XX secolo (Novecento)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Fu rappresentata per la prima volta al Teatro Bol'\u0161oj di Mosca"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Fu composta da P\xEBtr Il'i\u010D \u010Cajkovskij"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Debutt\xF2 a Parigi nell'Ottocento"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 un'opera lirica interamente cantata"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "In quanti atti \xE8 diviso il balletto Cenerentola?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: In 1 solo atto
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: In 3 atti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: In 5 atti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: In 12 atti
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Quali tra queste definizioni sono corrette?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Orchestra: un solo musicista che suona da solo'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Tempo: quanto sono colorati i costumi di scena'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Leitmotiv: un tema musicale ricorrente legato a un personaggio o a
          un''idea'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Valzer: una danza in 3/4, contata uno-due-tre'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Dinamiche: il nome del teatro di Mosca'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Prokof'ev diede a ogni personaggio il proprio leitmotiv. Quali descrizioni
        sono corrette?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Cenerentola: una melodia gentile e fluida'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Le sorellastre: note comiche e goffe'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Il Principe: ottoni nobili e maestosi'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'La Fata Madrina: timpani cupi e fragorosi'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Nella scena del Gran Ballo risuona il celebre valzer. Quali affermazioni
        sul valzer sono corrette?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 eseguito da un solo tamburo, senza altri strumenti"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 in tempo di 3/4: uno-due-tre, uno-due-tre"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Gli archi guidano, l'arpa scintilla e gli ottoni svettano
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Trasmette gioia, meraviglia e un po' di nervosismo
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Ha un ritmo di marcia in 4/4 '
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Se dovessi comporre la musica per la scena della mezzanotte (urgente
        e drammatica), quali scelte sarebbero pi\xF9 adatte a quanto hai imparato?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 3
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Un delicato assolo d'arpa, lento e dolce
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Accordi forti e improvvisi degli ottoni
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Piatti e percussioni fragorose per aumentare la tensione
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Un flauto leggero e giocoso
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Un valzer allegro e spensierato
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Timpani urgenti e drammatici
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
